  "body": "This well-presented home sits on a sought-after street in Stanmore Bay. Swann Beach, a quiet swimming cove between Big Manly and Stanmore Bay, is less known and mostly visited by locals and can be easily reached by nearby walkways. The location is close to Stanmore Bay Leisure Centre, Coast Plaza, and main transport routes.\r\n\r\nThis spacious home sits on a freehold 809 sqm section and has been owned by the same family for over 30 years. It has been well looked after and is in good condition. The gardens are well-established and there are plenty of fruit trees, you can tell this is a home that has been cherished.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, there is a large lounge that can be closed off from the kitchen and second living area, giving you flexibility and privacy. The modern kitchen is the heart of the home and opens out to a patio and a spacious, tiered backyard.\r\n\r\nThis level also has a double bedroom and a bathroom, making it ideal for older parents or guests since it is separate from the other bedrooms upstairs. There is also a separate laundry room on this floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three more double bedrooms, each with sea views over Swann Beach and Manly. This floor also has a family bathroom with a bath, shower, and separate toilet. The landing offers space that could be used as a home office.\r\n\r\nOther features include an internal double garage, plenty of storage, and extra parking spaces.\r\n\r\nHomes like this are rarely available in this area. If you want a spacious home with a large backyard, this one is worth a look.\r\n\r\nViewing is easy so if you can't make an open home please call me to arrange a private viewing. Early settlement is possible.\r\n\r\nConjunctional arrangements with other agents are welcome from the start.\r\n\r\nI look forward to meeting you soon.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/DJB5",
